  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provide Emergency HEALTH Facility (Maternity Care)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SHARE NGO established build an emergency health facility&apos;s to care for the poor rural mother&apos;s have a safe place to give birth. The facility was started majorly to provide antenatal care and postnatal healthcare, including prenatal assessments, birth assistance, and supplementation from pregnancy until the postpartum period to help them get safe birth control. The pregnant woman is checked and treated for any conditions which may harm her pregnancy, such as Malaria, Anaemia, HIV/AIDS, STDs.</narrative>
  </description>
